			<section class="book-page" id="why-i-wrote-page">
				<div class="page-body-content" style="height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 2.25rem 0.5rem; box-sizing: border-box;">
					<div style="max-width: 600px; margin: auto 0; text-align: left; width: 100%;">
						<h2 class="chapter-title" style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 2.75rem; font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; text-align: center; line-height: 1.15;">
							Why I Am Writing This&nbsp;Book
						</h2>

						<p style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-wrap: pretty;">
							I am writing this book first and foremost for the patients living with this horrific condition. Unless you have felt it yourself, no one can truly comprehend what it is like to wake up every morning with scalding fire in your mouth, only to be told that everything looks normal and that the pain is all in your&nbsp;head.
						</p>

						<p style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-wrap: pretty;">
							I am also writing this for dentists, doctors, and all medical professionals who want to help their patients but feel powerless when standard tests come back clear. Clinicians genuinely care, but they have never been given the missing biophysical roadmap connecting microscopic tooth leaks and dietary acids to trigeminal nerve&nbsp;pain.
						</p>

						<p style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; text-wrap: pretty;">
							My mission is simple: to offer real answers, validate your suffering, bridge the communication gap between chair and clinician, and help bring an end to this invisible&nbsp;nightmare.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="book-page" id="thank-you-page">
				<div class="page-body-content" style="height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 1.75rem 0.5rem; box-sizing: border-box;">
					<div style="max-width: 620px; margin: auto 0; text-align: left; width: 100%;">
						<h2 class="chapter-title" style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 1.85rem; font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 2.6rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; color: #0f172a; text-align: center;">
							Thank&nbsp;You
						</h2>

						<p style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 1.15rem; text-wrap: pretty;">
							To <strong>all the fellow sufferers in our Burning Mouth syndrome Facebook groups and online communities</strong>: thank you for welcoming me, sharing your daily struggles so openly, and proving that none of us are alone. Your courage, honesty, and shared symptom logs turned an isolating battle into a united search for&nbsp;answers.
						</p>

						<p style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 1.15rem; text-wrap: pretty;">
							To <strong>Peggy Sharr</strong>, author of <em>The Burning Mouth Syndrome Survival Guide</em>, whose pioneering work, empathy, and advocacy have offered comfort and validation to so many people navigating this difficult&nbsp;journey.
						</p>

						<p style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 1.15rem; text-wrap: pretty;">
							To <strong>all the dentists, doctors, and specialists</strong> who examined me, asked thoughtful questions, and did everything within their knowledge to help. Even when the diagnosis was elusive, you gave me valuable clues every single time that ultimately guided me to uncover the physical root cause of my&nbsp;pain.
						</p>

						<p style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 1.15rem; text-wrap: pretty;">
							To <strong>my family and close friends</strong>, whose patience, warmth, and steady belief carried me through sleepless nights, unpredictable pain flares, and relentless dietary trials.
						</p>

						<p style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; text-wrap: pretty;">
							My hope is that we continue learning from every shared experience, gathering real-world data to make future editions even better, and inspiring more research and books to help every person living with Burning Mouth&nbsp;Syndrome.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

