						<div style="margin-bottom: 1.6rem;">
							<div style="font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Part V &bull; The Future of Burning Mouth</div>
							<p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin: 0; text-wrap: pretty;">
