			<! -  Chapter 3: Who Patients Go and See, and What They Ask and Say (Page 1 of 2: The Top 10 Specialists)  - >
			<section class="book-page" id="page-chapter-3-specialists">
				<div id="chapter-4" style="scroll-margin-top: 5rem;"></div>
