							<div class="part-page-divider"></div>
							<p class="part-page-desc">Decoding the biological hardware: how dietary acids, Acid-Sensing Ion Channels (ASICs), exposed dentinal conduits, and microscopic hydrogen protons drive unceasing oral&nbsp;fire.</p>
