								<p><strong>From Pain Architecture to the Primary Fuel:</strong> Now that we understand how peripheral transduction, switchboard overload, and the antidromic axon reflex sustain the burn, what is the everyday chemical fuel that triggers Phase 1 in the first place? In Chapter 8, we explore what acid is and why it turns harmless sips of coffee, wine, or juice into blinding oral&nbsp;fire.</p>
