								<p><strong>The First Principle of BMS Onset:</strong> The event that seemed to cause your burning mouth was the final drop that made the bucket overflow. The bucket itself was filled over decades of cement fatigue, gum recession, broken fillings, and salivary decline. Next, in Chapter 8, we explore what acid is and why it turns everyday foods into blinding oral&nbsp;fire.</p>
