							<p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: #64748b; margin: 0 0 0.85rem; line-height: 1.45;">Because the trigeminal nerve supplies sensory wiring to the eyes (V<sub>1</sub>) and the jaw/ears (V<sub>3</sub> auriculotemporal branch), chronic oral fires frequently spill over into adjacent cranial branches. Grade your symptoms from 0 to 10 (0 = completely calm, 10 = severe pain, pressure, or fatigue):</p>

