											</td>
											<td style="padding: 0.55rem 0.6rem; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.78rem;">Auriculotemporal nerve (V<sub>3</sub>) &amp; TMJ ligament overload</td>
										</tr>
										<tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;">
											<td style="padding: 0.55rem 0.6rem; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;">Ear Ringing (Tinnitus) or Fluttering</td>
