								<p><strong>The Core Diagnostic Mindset:</strong> These elimination trials are scientific diagnostic tools, not permanent dogma. By systematically cutting the chemical fuel, you prove that your pain is physical, chemical, and reversible, creating the quiet baseline required to identify and seal your dental&nbsp;hardware.</p>
