										<td>Self-etching 3D cross-linked polymer lattice bonds to tooth structure and bridges perimeter gaps <a href="#src-38" class="cite-ref">[38]</a>.</td>
										<td><strong>1 to 2+ years</strong><br/><span style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: #64748b;">Impervious to acid wear</span></td>
