							<div class="book-callout-text">
								<p><strong>The Tipping Point Reality:</strong> BMS is not an inexplicable sudden mystery. It is a predictable threshold event where fifty years of hardware wear and exposed tubules meet a mid-life deficit in salivary buffering&nbsp;capacity.</p>
